1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
[A new day begins. It's the morning of Day 4.]

2
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:07,610
Wait, really? Okay, got it.

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,700
[They gather in the common area]

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,270
[Oh?]
[They gather in the common area]

5
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:09,940
Let's...

6
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,630
Sit in the middle. Yeah, middle, middle.

7
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:13,680
[2 cards on the table]

8
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:21,020
[Based on the past 3 days of voting,
top-ranked Kim Seungho (1st)
alongside Kim Hyeyeon and Jung Heejin (tied for 2nd)
earn the right to choose today's dates]

9
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:24,820
[1st place Kim Seungho gets to choose first.
The tied 2nd placers draw cards to see
who gets the chance to choose a date.
(They can only pick someone they haven't dated yet)]

10
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:28,100
[Heejin: At least I didn't embarrass myself.]

11
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:33,860
[Heejin: Maybe I still had a shot to go out.]

12
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,940
[Hyeyeon: Did I lead too many people on?]

13
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:38,870
[Hyeyeon: That actually worries me.]

14
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:40,740
[Hyeyeon: It really made me reflect.]

15
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:44,210
[Hyeyeon: Why did all these people vote for me?]

16
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:50,880
[Jinwoo: Seungho taking 1st didn't surprise me.]

17
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:53,290
[Jinwoo: Hyeyeon's rank makes sense, too.]

18
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:54,890
[Jinwoo: But Heejin really blew my mind.]

19
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:57,020
[Jinwoo: She never let it show.]

20
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:58,260
[Jinwoo: I had no clue she was this popular.]

21
00:00:58,260 --> 00:01:00,100
[Jinwoo: Man, I feel fooled.]

22
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:04,500
[Eunchae: Hyeyeon and I already went out once.]

23
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:09,039
[Eunchae: So I want to get
to know other people.]

24
00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:13,700
[Sujin: Guess I'm staying home again.]

25
00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:16,980
[Yongkyu: Want someone to pick me? Want to go out?]

26
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:19,940
[Who will Seungho pick today?]

27
00:01:19,940 --> 00:01:24,520
[Jinwoo: The popular ones
get special treatment. I'm so jealous.]

28
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:25,570
-Well, everyone needs to go on a date

29
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:27,720
[Sujin: Well, everyone needs to go on a date
at least once. We barely know each other.]

30
00:01:25,570 --> 00:01:26,640
-at least once. -True.

31
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,640
-We barely know each other. -Yeah, that makes sense.

32
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:30,920
[Hyeyeon: Yeah, that makes sense.]

33
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:29,830
We barely know each other,

34
00:01:29,830 --> 00:01:31,020
so everyone should try dating around.

35
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:33,590
[Seungho: That's actually my plan.]

36
00:01:32,530 --> 00:01:33,180
So...

37
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:36,259
[Hyeyeon: Is that your plan?]
[Jinwoo: Is that your plan?]

38
00:01:36,259 --> 00:01:37,860
[Seungho: Yeah, totally.]

39
00:01:36,690 --> 00:01:37,310
Totally.

40
00:01:37,860 --> 00:01:41,460
[Jinwoo: Leaving me at home...]

41
00:01:41,630 --> 00:01:44,170
-How dare you! -How dare you leave me behind?

42
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:44,620
[Embarrassed]

43
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:48,270
[Hyeyeon: Heejin and I will each pick one.]

44
00:01:48,270 --> 00:01:52,009
[Hyeyeon: Looks like whoever draws the heart gets the date.]

45
00:01:52,009 --> 00:01:56,860
[Chaebe: Let's step aside.]
[Jinwoo: Let's step aside.]

46
00:01:54,850 --> 00:01:56,300
-Back off. -Yeah, step back, step back.

47
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:57,039
Step back, step back.

48
00:01:56,860 --> 00:02:01,090
[Hyeyeon: We'll turn around, so shuffle them for us.]

49
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:01,090
-Sure. -These two.

50
00:02:01,090 --> 00:02:03,220
[Yongkyu: Oh, just these two?]

51
00:02:02,020 --> 00:02:03,080
-Yep. -OK.

52
00:02:03,730 --> 00:02:07,730
[Heejin: Yesterday, I really looked forward
to that date with Sujin.]

53
00:02:07,730 --> 00:02:10,400
[Heejin: But it fell short.]

54
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:14,670
[Heejin: This time, I really want to go out]

55
00:02:14,670 --> 00:02:16,010
[Heejin: with someone new.]

56
00:02:16,010 --> 00:02:20,810
[Heejin: If I had to pick right now,
I'd say Eunchae.]

57
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:28,550
