instead of Seungho,]

58
00:02:28,550 --> 00:02:32,820
[Hyeyeon: I'd rather go out with Sujin,
who's my actual second choice.]

59
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:35,490
[Hyeyeon: I really need to make it happen this time.]

60
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:42,940
[Which of the two gets to go out?]

61
00:02:40,870 --> 00:02:42,070
-Shuffled! -Really?

62
00:02:42,990 --> 00:02:44,790
-Let's see. -Pick one, pick one.

63
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:45,570
You first.

64
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:47,240
[Hyeyeon: You go first.]

65
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:49,370
[Heejin: I'm left-handed, so I'll grab the left one.]

66
00:02:50,970 --> 00:02:52,840
[Hyeyeon: Guess I get this one then.]

67
00:02:52,910 --> 00:02:54,320
1, 2, 3!

68
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:55,240
[Who got the heart?]

69
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,610
1, 2, 3!

70
00:02:57,650 --> 00:03:00,580
[Hyeyeon drew the heart]

71
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,560
I got it!

72
00:03:03,790 --> 00:03:05,390
[Heejin: Congrats!]

73
00:03:04,610 --> 00:03:05,530
Congrats!

74
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:08,860
[Hyeyeon has had great luck
drawing cards since Day 1]

75
00:03:08,820 --> 00:03:09,320
I choose...

76
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,780
-I'll pick first. -Go ahead.

77
00:03:09,390 --> 00:03:12,060
[1st place Seungho picks first]

78
00:03:13,930 --> 00:03:17,400
[Seungho: I'm interested in Jinwoo and Hyeyeon.]

79
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,540
[Seungho: But I couldn't ask either of them out.]

80
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:22,210
[Seungho: That's kind of a shame.]

81
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:27,010
[Besides Hyeyeon and Jinwoo,
who will Seungho choose?]

82
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:31,280
[Seungho: I pick Yongkyu.]

83
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:39,290
[Jinwoo: Wait, a new combo?]

84
00:03:39,579 --> 00:03:43,290
[Yongkyu: Seungho asked me out.]

85
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:45,960
[Yongkyu: It made my heart flutter.]

86
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:49,430
["Totally fluttering."]

87
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:54,420
[Chaebe: I actually figured Seungho]

88
00:03:54,420 --> 00:03:59,860
[Chaebe: would pick Yongkyu.]

89
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:04,910
[Chaebe: Maybe I saw him as competition?]

90
00:04:05,900 --> 00:04:10,340
[Seungho: Yongkyu texted me yesterday.]

91
00:04:10,340 --> 00:04:12,300
[Seungho: He said, "Let's go on a date tomorrow."]

92
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:15,320
[Seungho: But honestly, I've always wanted to]

93
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:17,990
[Seungho: talk to him.]

94
00:04:17,990 --> 00:04:20,399
[Seungho: That's why I chose him.]

95
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:24,930
[Jinwoo: Hyeyeon's dating someone else,]

96
00:04:24,930 --> 00:04:29,210
[Jinwoo: and Seungho picked Yongkyu,
so I don't really care as much.]

97
00:04:29,340 --> 00:04:31,610
[Next up, Hyeyeon makes her pick]

98
00:04:31,810 --> 00:04:35,080
[Hyeyeon: I... pick Sujin.]

99
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:37,750
[Hyeyeon: I pick Sujin.]

100
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:44,690
[Sujin: Since Hyeyeon showed zero interest in me,]

101
00:04:44,690 --> 00:04:46,820
[Sujin: I totally didn't see it coming]

102
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:48,260
[Sujin: when she picked me.]

103
00:04:48,260 --> 00:04:54,220
[Sujin: As for Hyeyeon...]

104
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:56,970
[Sujin: She's maybe my 4th or 5th choice?]

105
00:05:00,170 --> 00:05:04,710
[Hyeyeon: I kept wondering
when I'd ever get to date Sujin.]

106
00:05:04,710 --> 00:05:09,510
[Hyeyeon: Luckily it worked out,
so I was super excited.]

107
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:13,620
[Heejin: I felt so conflicted.
I didn't even know how to describe it.]

108
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:17,700
[Heejin: I was a little upset.]

109
00:05:17,700 --> 00:05:21,060
[Heejin: It's not like I have deep feelings
for those two,]

110
00:05:21,060 --> 00:05:28,460
[Heejin: but... I don't know.
Honestly, it kind of hurt.]

111
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:35,400
[Please go get ready for your dates]

112
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:35,590
-Go get ready. -Go get ready for your dates!

113
00:05:35,670 --> 00:05:38,870
[Jinwoo: Have fun.]
[Hyeyeon! See you tonight.]

114
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:38,990
Have fun, have fun!

115
00:05:39,409 --> 00:05:41,540
[Sujin: What are you wearing?
Should I wear this outfit?]

116
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:43,680
[Sujin: Or maybe matching pants?]

117
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:46,620
[Hyeyeon: Two options: go matching or don't.]

118
00:05:46,620 --> 00:05:50,090
[Hyeyeon: If we match, I'll wear this.]

119
00:05:50,820 --> 00:05:51,370
Looks good.

120
00:05:50,890 --> 00:05:55,690
[Picking date outfits with excited hearts]

121
00:05:51,370 --> 00:05:52,840
If we don't match...

122
00:05:53,390 --> 00:05:55,960
