124
00:06:01,060 --> 00:06:04,620
[Quiet] [Awkward]

125
00:06:04,620 --> 00:06:11,440
[Hyeyeon: Are you eating breakfast today?
You've still got a little time.]
[Heejin: Yeah, I gotta eat. It's a new day.]

126
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:15,710
[Hyeyeon: I thought you were heading back
to sleep since you're so tired.]

127
00:06:15,710 --> 00:06:19,720
[Heejin: I actually slept great last night.]
[Hyeyeon: Oh, really? That's awesome.]

128
00:06:17,970 --> 00:06:18,900
-Really? -Yeah.

129
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,050
[Heejin: Yep.]

130
00:06:21,050 --> 00:06:22,380
[Hyeyeon: Are you not comfortable
speaking casually with me?]

131
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:24,790
[Heejin: Oh, right! I keep slipping back
into formal speech.]

132
00:06:24,790 --> 00:06:26,920
[Heejin: I'll talk casually now.]

133
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:30,130
[Hyeyeon: Sounds good, Heejin.]

134
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:35,200
[Heejin: Let's speak casually.]
[Hyeyeon: Got it, Heejin.]

135
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:38,400
[Sujin gets ready for the date
and comes down to the 2nd floor]

136
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:41,340
[Heejin: Who's that?]
[Hyeyeon: Whoa, that bag is huge!]

137
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:45,880
[Sujin: I borrowed it from Jinwoo.]

138
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:52,740
[Heejin: You're wearing matching outfits.]
[Hyeyeon: I packed a bunch of clothes
so I could match with everyone.

139
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:55,340
[Me too.]

140
00:06:55,340 --> 00:06:58,950
[Sujin: Didn't we match in pastels yesterday too?]
[Heejin: Yep, pastel tones.]

141
00:06:58,950 --> 00:07:01,890
[Sujin: I like your hair better like this.
Nice and straight.]
[Heejin: Really?]

142
00:07:01,890 --> 00:07:04,030
[Sujin: This looks way better on you.]
[Heejin: Better than curls?]

143
00:07:04,030 --> 00:07:05,900
[Hyeyeon: See, I told you.]
[Heejin: Really?]

144
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:11,230
[Heejin: Should I just straighten it like this
from now on?]
[Hyeyeon: Love it, love it!]

145
00:07:11,230 --> 00:07:15,770
[Hyeyeon: We're heading out now. See you later.]
[Heejin: Have fun.]

146
00:07:15,770 --> 00:07:22,180
[Heejin: Look at these gorgeous girls.
So pretty. Safe travels!]

147
00:07:22,180 --> 00:07:25,650
[Hyeyeon: We'll be right back. See you soon.]

148
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:32,050
[Heejin: At first, I just thought,
"Oh, they're leaving."]

149
00:07:32,050 --> 00:07:36,330
[Heejin: But they kept saying goodbye
until the very last second.]

150
00:07:36,330 --> 00:07:42,200
[Heejin: And when Hyeyeon said, "We'll be right back,"]

151
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:46,740
[Heejin: that kind of made me sad.]

152
00:07:47,270 --> 00:07:51,460
[Do these two have any idea
how Heejin feels right now?]

153
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,360
We'll be right back.

154
00:07:51,460 --> 00:07:54,060
[Gangneung Station]

155
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:55,810
[Hyeyeon: I love taking the train
so much, seriously.]

156
00:07:55,810 --> 00:07:58,750
