where we're going.]

157
00:07:58,750 --> 00:08:00,880
[Sujin: Where are we going?]

158
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:03,290
[Sujin: Cheoram? Yangwon? Buncheon?]

159
00:08:03,290 --> 00:08:04,180
[Hyeyeon: Huh, really?]

160
00:08:04,340 --> 00:08:05,620
[Seoul? Seoul?]

161
00:08:05,660 --> 00:08:07,290
[Hyeyeon: Could be Seoul, could be somewhere else.]

162
00:08:07,290 --> 00:08:09,690
[Sujin: Wait, is there a place
called Buncheon in Seoul?]

163
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:13,960
[Where are they heading on the train?]

164
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:12,460
Where are we going?

165
00:08:12,460 --> 00:08:13,290
Is it here?

166
00:08:13,770 --> 00:08:14,830
-Is it here? -You go up first.

167
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,030
[Hyeyeon: You go up first.]

168
00:08:15,030 --> 00:08:16,370
[Sujin: Thanks, thanks!]

169
00:08:18,770 --> 00:08:20,640
[Sujin: Wow, it's so pretty.]

170
00:08:24,300 --> 00:08:25,660
[Sujin: I think this is it.]

171
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:34,780
[Sujin: Look, the Santa Village train is leaving!]

172
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:36,179
[Hyeyeon: Santa Village train?]

173
00:08:36,179 --> 00:08:38,140
[East Sea & Santa Village Train]

174
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:39,860
[Sujin: How are you feeling?]

175
00:08:39,860 --> 00:08:41,460
[Hyeyeon: Riding such a cute train]

176
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:44,130
[Hyeyeon: with you makes me so happy.]

177
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:46,000
[Sujin: Same here...]

178
00:08:46,530 --> 00:08:48,660
[Sujin: Sitting next to a beauty like you]

179
00:08:48,660 --> 00:08:49,730
[Sujin: and on such a beautiful train.]

180
00:08:49,730 --> 00:08:52,400
[Hyeyeon: Pretty sure the beauty on your mind
is someone else, though?]

181
00:08:53,470 --> 00:08:55,740
[Sujin: Come on, aren't you the same?]

182
00:08:55,740 --> 00:08:56,820
[Shh!]
[Sujin: Aren't you the same?]

183
00:08:58,540 --> 00:09:00,410
[Sujin: It's a secret!]

184
00:09:03,610 --> 00:09:04,950
[Hyeyeon: Whoa, look, the ocean!]

185
00:09:04,950 --> 00:09:06,820
[Sujin: Gorgeous, right? The sea.]

186
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,420
[Hyeyeon: Diving? Diving?]

187
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:08,650
Diving.

188
00:09:08,420 --> 00:09:10,550
[Sujin: Wait, are there female divers
out here right now?]

189
00:09:11,890 --> 00:09:13,300
[Hyeyeon: Whoa! Throw me an abalone!]

190
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:14,180
[Hahaha.]

191
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:16,180
[Sujin: Throw it up here? Tell her to toss it up?]

192
00:09:16,180 --> 00:09:17,220
[Throw me one!]

193
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,660
It's so beautiful.

194
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:20,100
[Hyeyeon: Do you like the ocean?]

195
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:23,100
[Hyeyeon: I've been coming to the ocean
two days in a row now.]

196
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:24,970
[Sujin: Getting sick of it?]

197
00:09:24,970 --> 00:09:28,440
[Hyeyeon: Coming here with you
makes it feel fresh again.]
[Sujin: Right.]

198
00:09:28,970 --> 00:09:31,910
[Hyeyeon: Yeah, it's really nice
to be here with you.]

199
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:34,460
[Hyeyeon: Looking at the sea
with you is gonna be fun.]
[Sujin: Yeah.]

200
00:09:34,460 --> 00:09:36,780
[Sujin: But I think today's gonna be even more fun.]

201
00:09:36,780 --> 00:09:37,780
[Hyeyeon: Same here.]

202
00:09:37,780 --> 00:09:41,250
[Sujin: We have more time together today...]

203
00:09:42,100 --> 00:09:45,700
[Sujin: Should be longer, right?]
[Hyeyeon: Oh, I thought you meant today's date
would be more fun than yesterday's.]

204
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:47,120
[Hyeyeon: My heart almost fluttered.]

205
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:49,100
[Sujin: That is what I meant!]
[Hyeyeon: Oh, really?]

206
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:50,330
[Sujin: Yeah! Compared to yesterday's date,]

207
00:09:50,330 --> 00:09:52,340
[Sujin: we get to spend
way more time together today,]

208
00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:54,420
[Sujin: so I think it will be better.]

209
00:09:54,420 --> 00:09:55,660
[Sujin: Don't you think so?]

210
00:09:56,020 --> 00:09:58,460
[Hyeyeon: And here I was, looking all hopeful!]

211
00:09:58,860 --> 00:10:01,100
[Full of anticipation]

212
00:10:00,210 --> 00:10:01,780
Let me check.

213
00:10:01,820 --> 00:10:03,140
[Sujin: Looks like it.]

214
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:09,700
[Hyeyeon: We look pretty good together, don't we?]

215
00:10:09,700 --> 00:10:11,060
[Sujin: Of course.]

216
00:10:11,060 --> 00:10:13,140
[Sujin: Our faces actually match really well.]

217
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:16,750
[Hyeyeon: Honestly, your face
looks good next to anyone.]

218
00:10:16,940 --> 00:10:19,140
[Sujin: Same goes for you.]
[Hyeyeon: I'm a little jealous, actually.]

219
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:20,500
[Oh...]

220
00:10:20,500 --> 00:10:23,160
[Hyeyeon: Feels like a lot of people are into you.]

221
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:24,760
[Hyeyeon: Your popularity votes were super...]

222
00:10:25,340 --> 00:10:26,390
1st place, 1st place! Wait!

223
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,430
[Sujin: You just went there yesterday!]

224
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:27,450
You just went there yesterday!

225
00:10:27,430 --> 00:10:28,620
[Sujin: You went to the secret room yesterday,
and now you're saying I'm popular?]

226
00:10:28,700 --> 00:10:30,260
[Flustered]

227
00:10:30,420 --> 00:10:31,620
[Sujin: Are you seriously saying that
with a straight face?]

228
