00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:05,810
[Heejin: I promised her yesterday,]

447
00:20:05,810 --> 00:20:08,220
[Heejin: so of course I have to keep my word.]

448
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:13,560
[And that's how today's menu was set: French toast]

449
00:20:09,250 --> 00:20:10,930
I've never even made French toast before.

450
00:20:10,930 --> 00:20:14,190
Showing off my non-existent skills
in front of a real cook.

451
00:20:14,620 --> 00:20:16,490
[Eunchae: But French toast is super easy.]

452
00:20:16,490 --> 00:20:19,690
[Heejin: Oh, Jinwoo's here!]
[Jinwoo: Were you resting in the main building?]

453
00:20:19,990 --> 00:20:23,170
[Yes!]
[Jinwoo: I suddenly thought of you
while I was in the annex.]

454
00:20:23,170 --> 00:20:24,500
[Jinwoo: I wondered what you were up to.]

455
00:20:24,770 --> 00:20:29,040
[Breakfast prep begins]

456
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:27,230
Should we fry up some shrimp to go with it?

457
00:20:27,230 --> 00:20:28,230
That sounds good.

458
00:20:29,170 --> 00:20:30,370
Wait, wait, wait!

459
00:20:29,300 --> 00:20:34,640
[Kitchen turns to chaos without the main chef]

460
00:20:30,370 --> 00:20:31,330
What happened? What's wrong?

461
00:20:31,330 --> 00:20:33,090
Oops, I think I got too much egg on it.

462
00:20:33,090 --> 00:20:34,610
Yeah, way too much.

463
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:39,180
[Chaebe: This is basically gonna be egg toast.]
[Eunchae: Quiet.]

464
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:40,970
Quiet.

465
00:20:40,780 --> 00:20:44,250
[Heejin: Wow, the garlic butter smells insane.]

466
00:20:44,250 --> 00:20:46,920
[Heejin: He really is a chef.]
[Jinwoo: Yeah, he's in the food industry.]

467
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:49,860
[Eunchae: Back in his element!]
[Jinwoo: Yep, back in his element.]

468
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:50,000
-His element! -In his element!

469
00:20:50,390 --> 00:20:57,070
[They somehow pull it off]

470
00:20:52,770 --> 00:20:53,790
Tastes amazing!

471
00:20:57,330 --> 00:20:59,470
[One last photo for the record]

472
00:20:59,470 --> 00:21:04,380
[Jinwoo: Oh, that looks pretty cute. Cute!]
[Chaebe: Right? Approved!]

473
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:09,080
[Heejin: How is it? How does it taste?]
[Jinwoo: Wow, it's really good.]

474
00:21:07,250 --> 00:21:07,980
Tastes good!

475
00:21:10,150 --> 00:21:13,620
[Chaebe: Doesn't need extra seasoning.]
[Jinwoo: Yeah, really good.]

476
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:13,890
Amazing.

477
00:21:13,620 --> 00:21:17,620
[Chaebe: I added a bit too much garlic,
is it okay? A bit heavy on garlic.]

478
00:21:15,830 --> 00:21:17,620
-A bit heavy on garlic. -It's seriously delicious.

479
00:21:17,620 --> 00:21:23,220
[Jinwoo: I love garlic.]
[Heejin: I love garlic too. It's great.]

480
00:21:23,220 --> 00:21:26,430
[Eunchae: Now I get what you mean by heavy garlic.]
[Chaebe: Yeah, a bit much.]

481
00:21:26,430 --> 00:21:30,430
[Eunchae: But it's totally fine, actually pretty good.]
[Chaebe: I put in like 4 scoops
because I added it twice.]

482
00:21:30,430 --> 00:21:36,040
[Jinwoo: We really are Korean.]
[Chaebe: I added it twice.
It would taste bland otherwise.]

483
00:21:36,040 --> 00:21:37,640
[Chaebe: Shall we try the toast?]

484
00:21:40,170 --> 00:21:40,970
I wanna try it!

485
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:42,980
[Chaebe: Mmm, the toast is good.]

486
00:21:42,980 --> 00:21:45,110
[Heejin: Really?]
[Jinwoo: You tried it already?]

487
00:21:45,110 --> 00:21:46,980
[Chaebe: Good!]
[Heejin: We have a French toast expert right here.]

488
00:21:45,850 --> 00:21:47,770
-Really? -We have a French toast expert right here!

489
00:21:46,980 --> 00:21:51,520
[Chaebe: It's the perfect sweet-and-savory combo.]
[Eunchae: He's a French toast expert!]

490
00:21:49,840 --> 00:21:50,870
As expected!

491
00:21:51,520 --> 00:21:53,390
[Heejin: It's so good!]
[Jinwoo: Really delicious!]

492
00:21:53,480 --> 00:21:54,580
It's so good!

493
00:21:53,660 --> 00:21:57,660
[A breakfast everyone loved]

494
00:21:54,580 --> 00:21:56,840
-Sweet and salty. -Vroom, vroom, vroom!

495
00:21:57,130 --> 00:21:57,790
Nice job!

496
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:08,870
[The members unwind in their own ways]

497
00:22:08,870 --> 00:22:14,210
[Seungho: Today's Day 4,
but I've only slept here twice.]
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

498
00:22:14,210 --> 00:22:15,810
[Seungho: Wait, no, I only slept here once!]

499
00:22:15,810 --> 00:22:17,950
[Jinwoo: Because you've been so busy.]
[Seungho: Yeah.]

500
00:22:17,950 --> 00:22:22,220
[Jinwoo: Why is your schedule
packed all by yourself?]
[Seungho: Beats me!]

501
00:22:22,220 --> 00:22:27,020
[Seungho: Got an SBM Talk notification.]
[Jinwoo: You? Reply to it.]

502
00:22:27,020 --> 00:22:34,230
[Seungho: Not now. It's a message I got
in the Secret Room yesterday.]
[Jinwoo: Whoa, really?]

503
00:22:34,230 --> 00:22:36,630
[Seungho: Why didn't you send one?]

504
00:22:38,020 --> 00:22:38,850
Well...

505
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:45,710
[Jinwoo: Didn't feel like I needed to,
since I already talked to you.]

506
00:22:45,710 --> 00:22:48,910
[Jinwoo: Were you waiting for my message?]
[Seungho: No, not really.]

507
00:22:48,910 --> 00:22:53,450
[Jinwoo: Oh, really? You weren't waiting?]
[Seungho: Nope.]

508
00:22:53,450 --> 00:22:57,720
[Seungho: I held hands.]
[Jinwoo: Huh?]

509
00:22:57,720 --> 00:23:00,120
[Seungho: I held hands.]
[Jinwoo: With who?]

510
00:23:00,120 --> 00:23:03,860
[Seungho: With both of you.]
[Jinwoo: You held hands with me, and with Hyeyeon?]

511
00:23:03,860 --> 00:23:07,060
[Seungho: I held hands
on both the pottery date and the beach date.]

512
00:23:07,060 --> 00:23:11,870
[Jinwoo: I don't really care about stuff like that.]
[Seungho: Just remembered.
I actually told Hyeyeon yesterday, too.]

513
00:23:11,870 --> 00:23:15,340
[Seungho: While making pottery,]
[Jinwoo: Told her we held hands?]

514
00:23:13,290 --> 00:23:15,340
-You told her we held hands? -I held hands with Jinwoo.

515
00:23:15,340 --> 00:23:18,540
[Jinwoo: Holding hands isn't a big deal,]

516
00:23:18,540 --> 00:23:21,740
[Jinwoo: but if you didn't have to,
but did it anyway,]

517
00:23:21,740 --> 00:23:24,150
[Jinwoo: you don't really need to tell me.]

518
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:29,480
[Seungho: I wanted to tell you.]
[Jinwoo: You wanted to tell me?]

519
00:23:29,500 --> 00:23:30,340
[Yeah.] [Why?]

520
00:23:30,340 --> 00:23:30,380
[Just felt like saying it.] [Why?]

521
00:23:30,820 --> 00:23:35,090
[Jinwoo: Wanting to see my reaction?]
[Seungho: It's fun.]

522
00:23:38,290 --> 00:23:41,900
[Jinwoo: But holding hands
looked better with us, right?]
[Seungho: Why?]

523
00:23:41,900 --> 00:23:43,980
[Jinwoo: Just my opinion.]

524
00:23:43,980 --> 00:23:46,100
[Seungho: No actual reason?]
[Jinwoo: Nope.]

525
00:23:46,100 --> 00:23:48,620
[Seungho: Is that blind confidence?]
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

526
00:23:48,620 --> 00:23:52,440
[Seungho: What...]
[Jinwoo: A little blind confidence,
and a little real confidence.]

527
00:23:53,510 --> 00:23:56,440
[Jinwoo: I'm sure of it.]

528
00:23:56,440 --> 00:24:00,450
[Jinwoo: But one thing's nice.
Hyeyeon doesn't smoke.]

529
00:24:00,450 --> 00:24:02,050
[Seungho: True, we talked about that too.]

530
00:24:02,050 --> 00:24:06,590
[Seungho: I told her you promised to quit
if I became your top pick,]

531
00:24:06,590 --> 00:24:08,720
[Seungho: and I really liked that about you.]

532
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:11,660
[Seungho: Then she said,
"Well, I don't smoke to begin with."]

533
00:24:11,660 --> 00:24:14,060
[Seungho: "I can just start smoking
and then quit for you."]

534
00:24:14,060 --> 00:24:18,600
[Jinwoo: Ah, Hyeyeon is so cute.]

535
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:22,340
[Jinwoo: But if I fail to quit,]

536
00:24:22,340 --> 00:24:24,740
[Jinwoo: you'd probably be disappointed in me.]

537
00:24:24,740 --> 00:24:27,680
[Seungho: Obviously.]

538
00:24:27,680 --> 00:24:30,880
[Seungho: If you can't quit,
you should just be honest from the start.]

539
00:24:30,880 --> 00:24:33,820
[Seungho: Making a promise and failing is way worse.]

540
00:24:35,980 --> 00:24:41,590
[Jinwoo: So yesterday,
after you went to the Secret Room,
I talked with Yongkyu and Sujin.]

541
00:24:41,590 --> 00:24:45,590
[Seungho: About what? Us? Now I'm curious.]

542
00:24:45,590 --> 00:24:49,590
[Jinwoo: Not about us, about me.
My own worries.]

543
00:24:49,590 --> 00:24:54,930
[Jinwoo: And earlier today, I talked with
Chaebe and Eunchae, too.]

544
00:24:54,930 --> 00:24:56,530
[Seungho: What'd you say?]

545
00:24:56,530 --> 00:24:58,140
[Jinwoo: What did I say...]

546
00:24:58,140 --> 00:25:01,610
[Jinwoo: I said I only focus on one person,
so without realizing it,]

547
00:25:01,610 --> 00:25:06,410
[Jinwoo: I end up putting up walls
whenever someone tries to get close to me.]

548
00:25:06,410 --> 00:25:12,550
[Jinwoo: Honestly, whether it's voting
or anonymous chats,]

549
00:25:12,550 --> 00:25:19,490
[Jinwoo: no one besides you showed interest in me.]

550
00:25:19,490 --> 00:25:22,160
[Jinwoo: No one else was curious about me.]

551
00:25:22,160 --> 00:25:25,360
[Jinwoo: Hearing that, Eunchae said]

552
00:25:25,360 --> 00:25:30,700
[Jinwoo: that because I only have eyes for you,]

553
00:25:30,700 --> 00:25:35,240
[Jinwoo: even if someone approached me,
they'd think they had no chance.]

554
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:40,310
[Seungho: If someone catches your interest,
go talk to them.]

555
00:25:40,310 --> 00:25:42,180
[Seungho: That's totally fine.]

556
00:25:42,180 --> 00:25:44,050
[Jinwoo: But I don't have anyone.]

557
00:25:44,050 --> 00:25:45,650
[Seungho: None? Nobody at all?]
[Jinwoo: Nope.]

558
00:25:45,650 --> 00:25:48,320
[Jinwoo: What do you think about what I said?]

559
00:25:53,660 --> 00:25:58,730
[Seungho: Well, how should I put it?]

560
00:25:58,730 --> 00:26:06,200
[Jinwoo: That's why I'm practicing how to loosen up.]

561
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:13,410
[Jinwoo: So when you picked Yongkyu today,
it didn't really hurt.]

562
00:26:13,410 --> 00:26:15,810
[Jinwoo: My natural thought was,]

563
00:26:15,810 --> 00:26:20,350
[Jinwoo: "Come to think of it,
you two haven't dated yet]

564
00:26:20,350 --> 00:26:23,290
[Jinwoo: and haven't talked deeply,
so you might be curious about him."]

565
00:26:23,290 --> 00:26:27,290
[Seungho: Something happened
between us that I never told him.]

566
00:26:27,290 --> 00:26:29,690
[Seungho: There's a specific reason I chose him.]

567
00:26:29,690 --> 00:26:33,430
[Jinwoo: But you didn't pick him
because you're romantically interested, right?]

568
00:26:33,430 --> 00:26:37,970
[Seungho: Right, I didn't.]

569
00:26:41,170 --> 00:26:42,770
[Jinwoo: Then I don't mind.]

570
00:26:43,580 --> 00:26:47,050
[Jinwoo: If I acted upset or angry,]

571
00:26:47,050 --> 00:26:51,850
[Jinwoo: I was afraid he'd see me as immature.]

572
00:26:51,850 --> 00:26:56,390
[Jinwoo: I told him, "Go on your date.]

573
00:26:56,390 --> 00:26:59,220
[Jinwoo: I'm good."]

574
00:26:59,220 --> 00:27:02,450
[Seungho: Regarding what Jinwoo said,]

575
00:27:02,450 --> 00:27:07,250
[Seungho: I felt he wasn't being fully honest,
which bothered me.]

576
00:27:07,250 --> 00:27:10,460
[Seungho: If he showed he liked me more,
been more forward,]

577
00:27:10,460 --> 00:27:14,460
[Seungho: and just admitted he was jealous
instead of saying things like that,]

578
00:27:14,460 --> 00:27:17,130
[Seungho: I would've liked that way more.]

579
00:27:17,930 --> 00:27:19,000
[Yongkyu: Shall we go?]

580
00:27:19,380 --> 00:27:21,860
[Parting briefly with Jinwoo,
Seungho leaves on a date with Yongkyu]

581
00:27:22,140 --> 00:27:24,070
[Seungho: What? Why are you here?]

582
00:27:24,600 --> 00:27:25,940
[Chaebe: You guys heading out on a date?]

583
00:27:25,940 --> 00:27:28,070
[Yongkyu: Do you work here or something?]

584
00:27:28,070 --> 00:27:29,670
[Seungho: We're heading out.]
[Yongkyu: We're heading out.]

585
00:27:29,670 --> 00:27:31,540
[Chaebe: Have fun.]

586
00:27:33,410 --> 00:27:36,080
[Chaebe: I feel a bit upset.]

587
00:27:36,080 --> 00:27:37,950
[Chaebe: I was a bit upset,]

588
00:27:37,950 --> 00:27:39,020
[Chaebe: but...]

589
00:27:39,020 --> 00:27:45,580
[Chaebe: he got to go on a date
with someone he's curious about.]

590
00:27:45,580 --> 00:27:49,690
[Chaebe: So... have fun, I guess?]

591
00:27:50,340 --> 00:27:52,460
[Chaebe: Though I'm a bit upset.]

592
00:27:56,020 --> 00:27:57,440
[Yongkyu: Get in.]

593
00:27:57,740 --> 00:27:58,770
[Seungho: Oh, I just get in?]

594
00:27:58,770 --> 00:28:01,170
[Yongkyu: Yeah, passenger seat.]

595
00:27:58,970 --> 00:28:01,170
-Yeah, passenger seat. -Passenger seat.

596
00:28:01,170 --> 00:28:03,040
[Yongkyu: Did you wanna sit in the back?]

597
00:28:05,710 --> 00:28:08,650
[Seungho: Oh, you're driving yourself.]

598
00:28:08,650 --> 00:28:10,520
[Seungho: I almost sat in the back.]

599
00:28:10,460 --> 00:28:12,000
-Put your clothes in the back. -Clothes.

600
00:28:10,520 --> 00:28:13,180
[Yongkyu: Put your clothes in the back...]

601
00:28:13,720 --> 00:28:14,790
[Seungho: Among all of us here,]

602
00:28:14,790 --> 00:28:16,920
[Seungho: I thought nobody here could drive.]

603
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:20,120
[Seungho: Oh right, Yongkyu can drive!]

604
00:28:20,390 --> 00:28:24,930
[Seungho: That was pretty cool.]

605
00:28:27,870 --> 00:28:31,870
[Yongkyu: So how is it? Are you enjoying...]

606
00:28:31,870 --> 00:28:35,070
[Seungho: Um... yeah!]

607
00:28:35,610 --> 00:28:38,280
[Yongkyu: We've barely]

608
00:28:38,280 --> 00:28:42,280
[Yongkyu: had a chance to talk one-on-on,]

609
00:28:42,280 --> 00:28:46,420
[Yongkyu: except for that brief chat on Day 1, right?]

610
00:28:47,580 --> 00:28:50,020
[Yongkyu: How did you feel after that chat? Like,]

611
00:28:50,020 --> 00:28:52,340
[Yongkyu: a bit curious, something like that?]

612
00:28:52,340 --> 00:28:54,380
[Seungho: Yeah, I was.]

613
00:28:54,740 --> 00:28:56,620
[Yongkyu: I see.]

614
00:28:57,580 --> 00:28:59,980
[Yongkyu: Since it was someone]

615
00:28:59,980 --> 00:29:01,700
[Yongkyu: I have feelings for,]

616
00:29:01,700 --> 00:29:03,300
[Yongkyu: there were a few things]

617
00:29:03,300 --> 00:29:04,630
[Yongkyu: I wanted to ask him.]

618
00:29:05,430 --> 00:29:09,170
[Seungho: On Day 1, did you wanna go outside?
Or stay in the living room?]

619
00:29:09,700 --> 00:29:11,570
[Yongkyu: I didn't care where we went.]

620
00:29:11,570 --> 00:29:14,510
[Yongkyu: I just wanted to talk with you.]

621
00:29:15,580 --> 00:29:17,180
[Yongkyu: Um... especially...]

622
00:29:17,180 --> 00:29:19,850
[Yongkyu: once I realized I liked you,]

623
00:29:19,850 --> 00:29:22,250
[Yongkyu: I got the chance to talk with you.]

624
00:29:22,250 --> 00:29:26,250
[Yongkyu: But I couldn't even look you in the eye.]

625
00:29:26,250 --> 00:29:29,140
[Seungho: When I saw you avoiding eye contact,
I wondered what was up.]

626
00:29:29,140 --> 00:29:33,730
[Yongkyu: I thought you might think
I was ignoring you.]

627
00:29:33,730 --> 00:29:36,500
[Yongkyu: So after that 1-on-1 talk,
I felt like I really messed up.]

628
00:29:37,660 --> 00:29:40,130
[Yongkyu: Oh, I'm kind of curious...]

629
00:29:40,130 --> 00:29:43,600
[Yongkyu: When you're dating
or getting to know someone,]

630
00:29:43,600 --> 00:29:46,810
[Yongkyu: you have things you like
and things you dislike.]

631
00:29:46,810 --> 00:29:48,680
[Yongkyu: Could you give me one example of each?]

632
00:29:49,210 --> 00:29:51,080
[Seungho: Things I dislike?]

633
00:29:52,410 --> 00:29:57,220
[Seungho: Like, "Hey, you"?]
[Yongkyu: Yeah, "Hey, you."(Talking casually)]

634
00:29:54,490 --> 00:29:56,450
-Hey, you, you. -Pretty much.

635
00:29:57,220 --> 00:29:59,350
[Yongkyu: Something about how people address you?]

636
00:29:59,350 --> 00:30:00,420
[Seungho: Even with friends,]

637
00:30:00,420 --> 00:30:04,430
[Seungho: if they just address me casually as "you,"
it gets on my nerves.]

638
00:30:04,430 --> 00:30:05,490
[Yongkyu: Oh, definitely.]

639
00:30:05,490 --> 00:30:07,900
[Yongkyu: Is that the only thing you dislike?]

640
00:30:07,900 --> 00:30:09,230
[Seungho: There's plenty more.]

641
00:30:09,230 --> 00:30:12,970
[Seungho: Saying all the right things
but never following through.]

642
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:17,240
[Yongkyu: That's a big one, too.]

643
00:30:17,660 --> 00:30:19,910
[Yongkyu: Totally spot on.]

644
00:30:23,110 --> 00:30:26,580
[Yongkyu: Oh, over there?]
[Seungho: Beautiful.]

645
00:30:27,650 --> 00:30:32,060
[Where is Seungho and Yongkyu's first date spot?]

646
00:30:28,760 --> 00:30:30,760
Looks like a house from a fairytale.

647
00:30:37,530 --> 00:30:41,800
[A boutique shop filled with all kinds of cute items]

648
00:30:38,400 --> 00:30:39,310
There's so much stuff!

649
00:30:39,310 --> 00:30:40,240
A boutique shop!

650
00:30:43,400 --> 00:30:45,800
[Seungho: The first thing I noticed was the alcohol?]

651
00:30:45,800 --> 00:30:47,300
[Yongkyu: Really?]

652
00:30:47,300 --> 00:30:48,470
[Yongkyu: Are you that into drinking?]

653
00:30:48,470 --> 00:30:51,580
[Seungho: No, I actually don't drink often.]

654
00:30:51,940 --> 00:30:53,270
[Yongkyu: Do you drink wine and stuff?]

655
00:30:53,270 --> 00:30:55,410
[Seungho: The first time I drank wine
was in the Secret Room.]

656
00:30:57,080 --> 00:30:58,680
[Seungho: Can we buy drinks?]

657
00:30:58,680 --> 00:31:00,580
[Yongkyu: Yeah!]

658
00:30:58,880 --> 00:31:00,220
-Yeah. -Really?

659
00:31:00,580 --> 00:31:02,020
[Yongkyu: Do you want something to drink?]

660
00:31:02,420 --> 00:31:05,360
[Yongkyu: This is so cute, too.]

661
00:31:05,360 --> 00:31:07,760
[Yongkyu: Go ahead and pick a drink.]

662
00:31:09,890 --> 00:31:12,300
[Seungho: I want this one.]

663
00:31:12,560 --> 00:31:14,430
[Yongkyu: Should we head over there?]

664
00:31:16,300 --> 00:31:18,700
[Yongkyu: Isn't this adorable?]
[Seungho: Oh, keychains!]

665
00:31:19,770 --> 00:31:21,370
[Seungho: Ah, do you like this kind of stuff?]

666
00:31:21,370 --> 00:31:22,970
[Yongkyu: Don't you think it's cute?]
[Seungho: Cute, sure.]

667
00:31:22,970 --> 00:31:26,460
[Yongkyu: I can't really carry one myself,
but I'd want my partner to.]

668
00:31:26,460 --> 00:31:30,020
[Yongkyu: If your partner said,
"Babe, can you hang this on your bag?"]

669
00:31:30,020 --> 00:31:31,520
[Yongkyu: would you actually put it on your bag?]

670
00:31:32,700 --> 00:31:34,020
[Seungho: Yeah, probably.]

671
00:31:34,020 --> 00:31:36,420
[Seungho: This one's pretty cute.
I could totally carry this one around.]

672
00:31:36,420 --> 00:31:38,190
[Yongkyu: They're all cute.]

673
00:31:38,190 --> 00:31:41,390
[Yongkyu: Since I haven't really
dated like this before,]

674
00:31:41,390 --> 00:31:44,330
[Yongkyu: it felt pretty nice.]

675
00:31:44,330 --> 00:31:46,900
[Yongkyu: It actually gave me butterflies.]

676
00:31:47,980 --> 00:31:49,930
[Seungho: Do you usually wear accessories?]

677
00:31:49,930 --> 00:31:51,270
[Yongkyu: Accessories?]

678
00:31:50,020 --> 00:31:51,270
-Accessories? -Like these.

679
00:31:51,270 --> 00:31:52,870
[Seungho: Necklaces or rings.]

680
00:31:54,210 --> 00:31:57,940
[Yongkyu: I'll wear them if I happen to have them.
But I don't really buy them myself.]

681
00:31:57,940 --> 00:32:00,340
[Seungho: Same here. But I want to try one on.]
[Yongkyu: Try it on then.]

682
00:32:01,060 --> 00:32:02,120
-This one. -A ring.

683
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:04,350
[Seungho: I want to wear this one.]
[Yongkyu: A necklace.]

684
00:32:05,680 --> 00:32:07,820
[Yongkyu: Hand it over. I'll put it on for you.]

685
00:32:13,160 --> 00:32:14,490
[Yongkyu: Once you try it on, you have to buy it.]

686
00:32:14,490 --> 00:32:15,560
[Seungho: Really?]

687
00:32:15,560 --> 00:32:16,630
[Yongkyu: Yep.]

688
00:32:17,700 --> 00:32:20,360
[Yongkyu: Oh, looks pretty good.]
[Seungho: Really?]

689
00:32:18,680 --> 00:32:19,610
-Really? -Yeah.

690
00:32:20,630 --> 00:32:23,840
[Yongkyu: Suits you well. Looks great.]

691
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:27,740
[Seungho: I like it.]

692
00:32:27,740 --> 00:32:29,970
[Yongkyu: Alright, buy one then!]

693
00:32:28,010 --> 00:32:29,610
-Alright, buy one! -So cute.

694
00:32:30,340 --> 00:32:32,910
[Seungho: I rarely wear accessories.]

695
00:32:32,910 --> 00:32:35,050
[Seungho: I just wanted to give it a shot.]

696
00:32:35,580 --> 00:32:37,180
[Seungho: It felt weird just wearing one myself,]

697
00:32:37,180 --> 00:32:39,320
[Seungho: so you pick one, too.]

698
00:32:39,320 --> 00:32:41,450
[Yongkyu: Should I pick a similar style then?]

699
00:32:42,300 --> 00:32:46,790
[Seungho: I wanted us to have matching necklaces,]

700
00:32:46,790 --> 00:32:49,460
[Seungho: so we bought necklaces together.]

701
00:32:49,990 --> 00:32:51,860
[Yongkyu: Should I just tie it on?]

702
00:32:51,990 --> 00:32:53,850
-Tie it. -Just tie it on directly.

703
00:32:54,530 --> 00:32:57,200
[Yongkyu: I don't really like wearing accessories.]

704
00:32:57,200 --> 00:33:00,940
[Yongkyu: Rings, bracelets, necklaces—
I don't own any of that at home.]

705
00:33:02,010 --> 00:33:03,880
[Yongkyu: Oh, pretty nice, right?]

706
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:08,680
[Seungho: Yeah, nice.]
[Yongkyu: Pretty good, huh?]

707
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,820
[Yongkyu: But seeing this,]

708
00:33:10,820 --> 00:33:12,950
[Yongkyu: I'll remember that we had this date.]

709
00:33:12,950 --> 00:33:15,620
[Yongkyu: I wanted to keep something
to remember it by.]

710
00:33:20,100 --> 00:33:23,500
[Shy]

711
00:33:24,160 --> 00:33:26,300
[Yongkyu: Shall we head out then?]

712
00:33:33,720 --> 00:33:35,580
Then I'll just...

713
00:33:37,780 --> 00:33:39,640
[Yongkyu: Uh, you get in the car first.]

714
00:33:49,790 --> 00:33:51,120
[Seungho: Can I drink this?]

715
00:33:51,120 --> 00:33:52,990
[Yongkyu: Yeah, go ahead.]

716
00:33:55,390 --> 00:33:56,730
[Yongkyu: You're pretty good at opening bottles.]

717
00:33:57,260 --> 00:33:59,930
[Seungho: I'm actually pretty strong, seriously.]

718
00:33:59,930 --> 00:34:01,000
[Yongkyu: Really?]

719
00:34:01,270 --> 00:34:03,740
[Seungho: Want to arm wrestle me?]

720
00:34:03,740 --> 00:34:04,810
[Yongkyu: Are you sure?]

721
00:34:04,810 --> 00:34:05,870
[Seungho: I probably can't beat you, though.]

722
00:34:05,870 --> 00:34:08,810
[Yongkyu: Ah, but even if I win,]

723
00:34:08,810 --> 00:34:10,409
[Yongkyu: it'd feel like I lost.]

724
00:34:14,679 --> 00:34:17,739
[Yongkyu: How is it? Feeling better now?]
[Seungho: Tastes amazing!]

725
00:34:17,739 --> 00:34:20,820
[Meanwhile, back at the house...]

726
00:34:22,020 --> 00:34:24,020
[Heejin: Did you two talk?]

727
00:34:24,020 --> 00:34:26,690
[Jinwoo: We just talked.
We had a pretty deep conversation, actually.]

728
00:34:26,690 --> 00:34:29,630
[Heejin: Deep conversation? About what? Can I ask?]

729
00:34:29,630 --> 00:34:32,830
[Jinwoo: Toward the end of our chat, it...]

730
00:34:32,830 --> 00:34:35,340
[Jinwoo: it didn't really feel like
a pleasant conversation.]

731
00:34:35,340 --> 00:34:38,170
[Heejin: Really? Like what part?]

732
00:34:38,170 --> 00:34:41,909
[Jinwoo: Like a certain habit. He mentioned it.]

733
00:34:41,909 --> 00:34:42,980
[Jinwoo: He asked if we ended up together,]

734
00:34:42,980 --> 00:34:46,449
[Jinwoo: could I give it up.]

735
00:34:46,449 --> 00:34:47,520
[Jinwoo: Without really thinking,]

736
00:34:47,520 --> 00:34:50,260
[Jinwoo: I just said, "Yeah, I'll quit. I can quit."]

737
00:34:50,260 --> 00:34:54,580
[Jinwoo: But thinking about it carefully,
it actually seems pretty tough.]

738
00:34:54,580 --> 00:34:55,620
[Jinwoo: So I said, "If]

739
00:34:55,620 --> 00:34:59,420
[Jinwoo: "we end up together,
and I can't quit,]

740
00:34:59,420 --> 00:35:02,780
[Jinwoo: would you feel disappointed
or turned off by me?"]

741
00:35:02,780 --> 00:35:04,650
[Jinwoo: He was like, "Probably, yeah.]

742
00:35:04,650 --> 00:35:06,780
[Jinwoo: And if you can't quit, why did you]

743
00:35:06,780 --> 00:35:11,140
[Jinwoo: tell me you would?"]

744
00:35:11,140 --> 00:35:12,020
[Heejin: But...]

745
00:35:12,020 --> 00:35:13,060
[Heejin: was it all about smoking?]

746
00:35:13,060 --> 00:35:14,500
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

747
00:35:14,520 --> 00:35:16,920
[Jinwoo: Setting that aside for a second,]

748
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:19,050
[Jinwoo: he keeps bringing up]

749
00:35:19,050 --> 00:35:21,460
[Jinwoo: the person he's considering
right in front of me.]

750
00:35:21,460 --> 00:35:22,520
[Jinwoo: I get talking about it,]

751
00:35:22,520 --> 00:35:25,460
[Jinwoo: but that wasn't even the situation.]

752
00:35:25,460 --> 00:35:28,660
[Jinwoo: So why keep bringing other people up?]

753
00:35:28,660 --> 00:35:31,600
[Heejin: Yeah, he really shouldn't.]

754
00:35:31,600 --> 00:35:34,540
[Jinwoo: What was the first thing we talked about?]

755
00:35:34,540 --> 00:35:35,600
[Jinwoo: He asked me how I felt
about long-distance relationships,]

756
00:35:35,600 --> 00:35:37,470
[Jinwoo: if I knew where he lived,]

757
00:35:37,470 --> 00:35:38,540
[Jinwoo: and if I'd be okay with that.]
[Heejin: Where does he live?]

758
00:35:38,540 --> 00:35:41,740
[Jinwoo: Jeongnam.]

759
00:35:41,740 --> 00:35:47,350
[Jinwoo: I said, "Well, it is what it is."
Right after I said that,]

760
00:35:47,350 --> 00:35:49,220
[Jinwoo: he goes, "Ah...]

761
00:35:49,220 --> 00:35:52,420
[Jinwoo: I asked her yesterday,
and she gave the exact same answer."]

762
00:35:53,220 --> 00:35:55,090
[Heejin: Whoa, he actually said that?]

763
00:35:55,090 --> 00:35:59,360
[Jinwoo: So right from that moment,
it totally killed the mood.]

764
00:35:59,360 --> 00:36:03,420
[Jinwoo: After that, he kept repeatedly
bringing stuff like that up,]

765
00:36:03,420 --> 00:36:05,230
[Jinwoo: so I gradually...]

766
00:36:05,230 --> 00:36:08,860
[Jinwoo: got pretty annoyed. Because...]
[Heejin: Well, you should've called him out
right then.]

767
00:36:08,860 --> 00:36:12,710
[Heejin: Like, "Why are you bringing her up?"]

768
00:36:12,710 --> 00:36:15,260
[Heejin: You should've told him.]
[Jinwoo: So all my frustration boiled over into this.]

769
00:36:15,260 --> 00:36:17,060
[Heejin: Ah, don't hold it in.]

770
00:36:17,540 --> 00:36:20,450
[Jinwoo: Anyway, before bringing that up, well,]

771
00:36:20,450 --> 00:36:22,850
[Jinwoo: I wanted to talk to him
about the smoking thing first.]

772
00:36:22,850 --> 00:36:25,250
[Jinwoo: If I'm gonna tell him...]

773
00:36:25,250 --> 00:36:27,660
[Jinwoo: But if we can't get past the smoking issue,]

774
00:36:27,660 --> 00:36:30,060
[Jinwoo: talking about anything else
after that feels pointless.]

775
00:36:30,060 --> 00:36:33,530
[Heejin: You're right. That's true.]
[Jinwoo: Honestly, it just feels hopeless.]

776
00:36:33,530 --> 00:36:36,200
[Jinwoo: To be honest, I think
he sees us the same way.]

777
00:36:36,200 --> 00:36:37,260
[Jinwoo: I don't know his true thoughts,]

778
00:36:37,260 --> 00:36:39,670
[Jinwoo: but since he asked her
the exact same question...]

779
00:36:39,670 --> 00:36:42,340
[Heejin: No, he was probably just asking.]

780
00:36:42,340 --> 00:36:45,270
[Heejin: He thinks long distance]

781
00:36:45,270 --> 00:36:48,480
[Heejin: is a big deal in a relationship.]

782
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:52,210
[Heejin: So he wanted to make sure.]

783
00:36:52,210 --> 00:36:56,220
[Heejin: Simply put,
that's one of his dealbreakers.]

784
00:36:56,220 --> 00:36:57,820
[Heejin: I have questions like that, too.]

785
00:36:57,820 --> 00:37:01,020
[Heejin: So I would ask everyone I'm interested in.]

786
00:37:01,020 --> 00:37:01,820
[Jinwoo: Oh, really?]

787
00:37:01,680 --> 00:37:02,310
Yeah.

788
00:37:01,820 --> 00:37:03,690
[Heejin: Yeah.]

789
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:06,890
[Heejin: After listening to Jinwoo,
I was kind of surprised.]

790
00:37:06,890 --> 00:37:10,360
[Heejin: They seemed so happy together.]

791
00:37:10,360 --> 00:37:13,030
[Heejin: I thought it was super sweet between them.]

792
00:37:13,030 --> 00:37:14,900
[Heejin: But then I found out]

793
00:37:14,900 --> 00:37:18,910
[Heejin: that they had issues
no one could've guessed.]

794
00:37:18,910 --> 00:37:19,970
[Heejin: Also, during all this,]

795
00:37:19,970 --> 00:37:22,640
[Heejin: I realized I wasn't the only one
struggling and stressing out.]

796
00:37:22,640 --> 00:37:24,510
[Heejin: Everyone has something]

797
00:37:24,510 --> 00:37:27,450
[Heejin: they're struggling with.]

798
00:37:27,450 --> 00:37:30,120
[Heejin: So it actually felt a bit comforting.]

799
00:37:30,120 --> 00:37:33,050
[Heejin: Wait, I'm suddenly getting confused.
How old is Eunchae?]

800
00:37:33,050 --> 00:37:36,260
[Jinwoo: She was born in '05. She's 22.]

801
00:37:36,260 --> 00:37:37,860
[Heejin: OK.]

802
00:37:37,860 --> 00:37:40,260
[Heejin: Ah, then how old is Hyeyeon?]

803
00:37:40,260 --> 00:37:42,660
[Jinwoo: Hyeyeon was born in '02, 25 years old.]

804
00:37:42,660 --> 00:37:45,070
[Heejin: 20... Ah...]

805
00:37:45,070 --> 00:37:48,800
[Heejin: '05... Wait, if it's '05...]

806
00:37:48,800 --> 00:37:50,940
[Heejin: '05?]

807
00:37:51,500 --> 00:37:53,460
[Jinwoo: 1 year older than Seungho.]

808
00:37:53,460 --> 00:37:55,380
[Jinwoo: Eunchae is still young.]

809
00:37:55,380 --> 00:37:58,680
[Heejin: '05?]
[Jinwoo: Eunchae really is still a kid.]

810
00:37:58,680 --> 00:37:59,940
[Heejin: Wow!]

811
00:37:59,940 --> 00:38:03,410
[Jinwoo: But she seemed young to me
the moment I met her.]

812
00:38:03,410 --> 00:38:06,080
[Heejin: Ah, I felt it during our chat today.]

813
00:38:06,080 --> 00:38:08,220
[Jinwoo: Oh, you saw her childish side?]

814
00:38:08,220 --> 00:38:10,090
[Jinwoo: When?]
[Heejin: She really is just a kid.]

815
00:38:10,090 --> 00:38:14,630
[Heejin: Just super shy.]
[Jinwoo: Ah, very shy.]

816
00:38:15,960 --> 00:38:20,760
[Chaebe: I didn't expect those two to get this far.]

817
00:38:20,760 --> 00:38:25,180
[Eunchae: What do you mean? Those two...]
[Chaebe: You know, Jinwoo and...]

818
00:38:25,180 --> 00:38:26,370
[Eunchae: Seungho?]
[Chaebe: Jinwoo and...]

819
00:38:25,550 --> 00:38:26,460
-Seungho. -Yeah.

820
00:38:26,370 --> 00:38:29,340
[Eunchae: You didn't expect them to get this far?]
[Chaebe: Yeah. Did you know all along?]

821
00:38:29,340 --> 00:38:31,500
[Absurd]

822
00:38:31,580 --> 00:38:34,110
[Chaebe: Did you know all along?]

823
00:38:34,110 --> 00:38:36,250
[Eunchae: Are you usually good at reading the room?]

824
00:38:36,250 --> 00:38:39,980
[Chaebe: Totally.]

825
00:38:39,980 --> 00:38:44,790
[Chaebe: I thought Seungho definitely...]

826
00:38:44,790 --> 00:38:47,730
[Chaebe: definitely liked Yongkyu.]

827
00:38:47,730 --> 00:38:49,860
[Eunchae: From the start?]
[Chaebe: Yeah.]

828
00:38:49,860 --> 00:38:50,660
[Eunchae: Why?]
[Chaebe: Well...]

829
00:38:50,660 --> 00:38:53,060
[Chaebe: Didn't they ask Seungho?]

830
00:38:53,060 --> 00:38:56,800
[Chaebe: He said he always stares
at the person he likes.]

831
00:38:56,800 --> 00:39:01,870
[Chaebe: I feel like he is staring
at Yongkyu the whole time.]

832
00:39:02,410 --> 00:39:07,750
[Chaebe: So I didn't think Seungho]

833
00:39:07,750 --> 00:39:10,680
[Chaebe: felt the same way about Jinwoo.]

834
00:39:10,680 --> 00:39:14,690
[Chaebe: It was just Jinwoo's one-sided crush.]

835
00:39:14,690 --> 00:39:17,100
[Eunchae: No.]
[Chaebe: Am I the only one who didn't know?]

836
00:39:17,100 --> 00:39:18,380
[Eunchae: Yep.]
[Chaebe: Am I the only one who didn't know?]

837
00:39:18,420 --> 00:39:21,890
[Eunchae: Everyone knows.]

838
00:39:21,890 --> 00:39:26,160
[Chaebe: Wow, my intuition is so off.]

839
00:39:26,160 --> 00:39:28,570
[Chaebe: But they went out together today.]

840
00:39:28,570 --> 00:39:32,940
[Chaebe: Maybe my gut wasn't
completely wrong after all.

841
00:39:33,370 --> 00:39:34,710
[Eunchae: What's your plan?]

842
00:39:34,710 --> 00:39:37,110
[Chaebe: I probably won't change my mind.]

843
00:39:37,110 --> 00:39:38,710
[Chaebe: Even though it's exhausting,]

844
00:39:38,710 --> 00:39:41,650
[Chaebe: well...]

845
00:39:41,650 --> 00:39:46,180
[Chaebe: isn't it better to keep trying?]

846
00:39:46,180 --> 00:39:48,900
[Eunchae: You weren't actually
planning to give up anyway.]

847
00:39:48,900 --> 00:39:49,920
[Yeah.] [Eunchae: You weren't actually planning
to give up anyway.]

848
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:52,590
[Chaebe: Sad.]

849
00:39:52,590 --> 00:39:55,260
[Chaebe: Anything going on with you?]
[Eunchae: Me?]

850
00:39:55,260 --> 00:39:57,660
[Eunchae: Need to spend more time to know for sure.]
[Chaebe: Who is it?]

851
00:39:57,660 --> 00:39:59,800
[Eunchae: What?]
[Chaebe: Who is it?]

852
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:00,600
[Eunchae: Beats me.]
[Chaebe: Who?]

853
00:40:00,600 --> 00:40:03,800
[Chaebe: Ah, how can you not know?]

854
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:05,400
[Chaebe: How can you not know? Tell me!]

855
00:40:05,400 --> 00:40:08,610
[Eunchae: No way, no way.]
[Chaebe: Why? Didn't you tell someone else?]

856
00:40:08,610 --> 00:40:10,470
[Eunchae: I didn't say anything!]
[Chaebe: Ah, really?]

857
00:40:10,470 --> 00:40:11,280
[Eunchae: Yeah.]
[Chaebe: Ah, really?]

858
00:40:11,280 --> 00:40:13,680
[Eunchae: What I talked about with Sujin yesterday]

859
00:40:13,680 --> 00:40:15,010
[Eunchae: wasn't what we were just talking about.]

860
00:40:15,010 --> 00:40:17,150
[Chaebe: Ah, really?]
[Eunchae: It's something else.]

861
00:40:17,150 --> 00:40:20,350
[Chaebe: Then what was it?]
[Eunchae: I won't say anything unless I'm sure.]

862
00:40:20,350 --> 00:40:21,690
[Eunchae: I'm not someone
who says that kind of thing lightly.]

863
00:40:21,690 --> 00:40:23,220
[Chaebe: Ah, really?]

864
00:40:23,220 --> 00:40:27,020
[Eunchae: Ah, plus I don't know either.
I'm totally confused.]

865
00:40:27,020 --> 00:40:29,430
[Eunchae: I need to figure things out
before I can tell you.]

866
00:40:29,430 --> 00:40:32,100
[Chaebe: Wait, did you get anything then?]
[Eunchae: Get what?]

867
00:40:32,100 --> 00:40:34,500
[Chaebe: Like votes.]
[Eunchae: Yeah.]

868
00:40:34,500 --> 00:40:37,700
[Chaebe: So that's why you're struggling?]
[Eunchae: Yeah.]

869
00:40:37,700 --> 00:40:39,040
[Chaebe: Why?]
[Eunchae: Well...]

870
00:40:39,040 --> 00:40:41,170
[Eunchae: I just don't know why...]

871
00:40:41,170 --> 00:40:42,510
[Chaebe: Why they picked you?]
[Eunchae: Yeah.]

872
00:40:42,510 --> 00:40:47,310
[Eunchae: I'm just curious about the reason.]

873
00:40:47,310 --> 00:40:49,180
[Eunchae: Did they pick me]

874
00:40:49,180 --> 00:40:51,580
[Eunchae: because they actually wanted to date me?]

