1318
01:00:23,150 --> 01:00:25,820
[Seungho: What if I mess it up and it tastes bad?]

1319
01:00:27,160 --> 01:00:28,490
[Yongkyu: But...]

1320
01:00:28,490 --> 01:00:29,830
[Yongkyu: Do we still need a pot?]

1321
01:00:29,830 --> 01:00:31,960
[Seungho: Is there a pot inside?]

1322
01:00:31,960 --> 01:00:33,560
[Seungho: This needs to be cooked in a pot.]

1323
01:00:33,560 --> 01:00:36,500
[Seungho: Then let's cook the ramen and army stew
in the car?]

1324
01:00:36,500 --> 01:00:38,630
[Yongkyu: Are we cooking the ramen right now?]

1325
01:00:38,630 --> 01:00:40,240
[Seungho: Around the same time as the meat?]

1326
01:00:41,010 --> 01:00:41,340
Let's eat them together.

1327
01:00:41,300 --> 01:00:42,910
[Yongkyu: Around the same time?
Seungho: You usually eat them together.]

1328
01:00:42,910 --> 01:00:45,840
[Yongkyu: Is that so?
Seungho: When I'm at home...]

1329
01:00:44,560 --> 01:00:45,300
Then...

1330
01:00:45,840 --> 01:00:49,050
[Yongkyu: Then let's cook the army stew first.]

1331
01:00:45,990 --> 01:00:49,070
Let's cook the army stew first. Just pour it in.

1332
01:00:49,050 --> 01:00:51,180
[Seungho: Just pour it in and let it boil?]

1333
01:00:49,070 --> 01:00:51,180
-Just pour it in and let it boil?
-Yeah.

1334
01:00:51,180 --> 01:00:54,380
[Yongkyu: And heat up the rice too, right?]

1335
01:00:53,400 --> 01:00:54,400
Rice too...

1336
01:00:54,380 --> 01:00:56,790
[Seungho: Leave it all to me.]

1337
01:00:54,400 --> 01:00:55,160
Give it to me.

1338
01:00:56,790 --> 01:00:58,390
[Seungho: You focus on the grilling.]

1339
01:00:58,390 --> 01:01:00,260
[Yongkyu: Now put the meat on.
Seungho: OK!]

1340
01:01:02,390 --> 01:01:08,140
[Yongkyu grilling and
Seungho cooking the army stew]

1341
01:01:09,100 --> 01:01:12,900
[Seungho: What should we grill first?]

1342
01:01:12,900 --> 01:01:15,820
[Yongkyu: Pork neck or belly.
Which one do you want?]

1343
01:01:16,740 --> 01:01:18,670
[Seungho: Both?]

1344
01:01:19,700 --> 01:01:21,610
[Yongkyu: Always unexpected, huh?]

1345
01:01:23,750 --> 01:01:28,180
[Unexpectedly.
Grilling pork belly and neck together]

1346
01:01:32,560 --> 01:01:34,420
[Yongkyu: Can we finish the sausages too?]

1347
01:01:34,420 --> 01:01:35,490
[Seungho: Yeah.]

1348
01:01:35,760 --> 01:01:37,090
[Yongkyu: We can't leave any leftovers.]

1349
01:01:37,090 --> 01:01:38,960
[Seungho: I promise there won't be.]

1350
01:01:38,960 --> 01:01:41,630
[Seungho: I told you on day one
that I eat a lot, right? I'll show you today.]

1351
01:01:41,630 --> 01:01:42,970
[Yongkyu: I believe you.]

1352
01:01:46,340 --> 01:01:48,980
[Adding sausages]

1353
01:01:56,740 --> 01:01:59,220
[Carefully]

1354
01:02:00,850 --> 01:02:05,260
[Seungho: I accidentally put the bowl
on the stove. It's so hot!]

1355
01:02:05,260 --> 01:02:07,190
[Yongkyu: You did that
so I could keep eating it warm, right?]

1356
01:02:07,190 --> 01:02:09,130
[Seungho: Seems like it.]

1357
01:02:09,390 --> 01:02:12,600
[Rice is done too.
Ready to eat]

1358
01:02:13,130 --> 01:02:14,730
[Seungho: It's all ready now.]

1359
01:02:16,600 --> 01:02:19,800
[Meat happens to be cooked perfectly]

1360
01:02:17,270 --> 01:02:19,940
The meat is already cooked. We can eat.

1361
01:02:23,010 --> 01:02:24,340
[Yongkyu: Want to try some?]

1362
01:02:24,340 --> 01:02:25,940
[Seungho: Just the meat?]

1363
01:02:25,940 --> 01:02:27,540
[Yongkyu: Have a piece first.]

1364
01:02:31,020 --> 01:02:32,140
[Mmm~]

1365
01:02:32,140 --> 01:02:33,860
[Wow!]

1366
01:02:34,750 --> 01:02:36,090
[Seungho: This is truly, truly classic.]

1367
01:02:37,420 --> 01:02:39,560
[Yongkyu: That good?]

1368
01:02:41,690 --> 01:02:42,760
[Seungho: Delicious.]

1369
01:02:47,830 --> 01:02:50,500
[Yongkyu: It's pretty good.]

1370
01:02:48,000 --> 01:02:49,530
-It's pretty good.
-Right?

1371
01:02:50,500 --> 01:02:52,100
[Seungho: You haven't eaten much
today either, right?]

1372
01:02:52,100 --> 01:02:53,970
[Yongkyu: Yeah.]

1373
01:02:53,970 --> 01:02:55,300
[Yongkyu: It's pretty good.]

1374
01:02:55,300 --> 01:02:56,910
[Seungho: Yeah, the soup is delicious too.]

1375
01:03:01,180 --> 01:03:02,510
[Yongkyu: Want a drink?]

1376
01:03:02,510 --> 01:03:05,180
[Yongkyu: What do you want?
Seungho: Fanta.]

1377
01:03:06,520 --> 01:03:07,580
[Yongkyu: Are you looking?]

1378
01:03:07,580 --> 01:03:09,190
[Seungho: I already picked it.]

1379
01:03:09,190 --> 01:03:11,320
[Yongkyu: What if I chose Fanta?
What will you do?]

1380
01:03:11,320 --> 01:03:13,190
[Seungho: Then I'd give it to you.]

1381
01:03:13,720 --> 01:03:15,590
[Seungho: Actually, I wouldn't give in.]

1382
01:03:16,930 --> 01:03:17,990
[Yongkyu: Really?]

1383
01:03:17,990 --> 01:03:19,860
[Seungho: No, no, just kidding.]

1384
01:03:24,960 --> 01:03:26,830
[Seungho: So delicious.]

1385
01:03:28,580 --> 01:03:33,120
[Yongkyu: So nice, eating outdoors
after a long time.]

1386
01:03:34,450 --> 01:03:35,790
[Yongkyu: How is it? Cooking and eating outside?]

1387
01:03:35,790 --> 01:03:36,860
[Seungho: It's delicious.]

1388
01:03:36,860 --> 01:03:38,990
[Seungho: And it feels new.]

1389
01:03:37,020 --> 01:03:39,300
-Does it feel different?
-It feels new.

1390
01:03:40,590 --> 01:03:42,190
[Seungho: It's definitely more atmospheric.]

1391
01:03:42,190 --> 01:03:44,600
[Seungho: It even tastes better, right?]

1392
01:03:44,600 --> 01:03:47,000
[Seungho: The food itself really does
taste better too.]

1393
01:03:48,870 --> 01:03:49,940
[Yongkyu: Aren't you cold?]

1394
01:03:49,020 --> 01:03:50,140
-Aren't you cold?
-Not at all.

1395
01:03:49,940 --> 01:03:51,800
[Yongkyu: Because I have a fire on my side...]

1396
01:03:51,800 --> 01:03:52,870
[Seungho: Not really cold.]

1397
01:04:04,650 --> 01:04:06,780
[Seungho: Should I not have added Kimchi?]

1398
01:04:08,650 --> 01:04:10,790
[Yongkyu: Is that for me?
Seungho: Yeah.]

1399
01:04:17,620 --> 01:04:18,020
[Seungho: Is it good?]

1400
01:04:18,020 --> 01:04:19,600
[Nods.
Seungho: Is it good?]

1401
01:04:23,330 --> 01:04:25,200
[Yongkyu: Look at the sky over there.]

1402
01:04:25,200 --> 01:04:27,870
[Seungho: Hang on. Let me finish this.]

1403
01:04:27,870 --> 01:04:30,010
[Yongkyu: You really can eat a lot.]

1404
01:04:30,810 --> 01:04:33,100
[Seungho: What? Do you love skies like this best?]

1405
01:04:33,100 --> 01:04:34,540
[Yongkyu: Yeah, I love it.]

1406
01:04:36,410 --> 01:04:39,880
[Yongkyu: It seems we came
at just the right time.]

1407
01:04:40,150 --> 01:04:42,020
[Yongkyu: If we had come earlier,
we wouldn't have seen this.]

1408
01:04:42,020 --> 01:04:42,820
[Seungho: Yeah.]

1409
01:04:42,820 --> 01:04:46,020
[Yongkyu: It's most beautiful just before sunset.]

1410
01:04:47,620 --> 01:04:50,830
[Yongkyu: How does it feel?
Going on a date with me today?]

1411
01:04:52,700 --> 01:04:55,100
[Seungho: First of all, it feels different.]

1412
01:04:55,100 --> 01:04:57,770
[Seungho: Compared to when we were at BI-LIVE.]

1413
01:04:57,770 --> 01:05:02,040
[Yongkyu: Anything different
from what you imagined?]

1414
01:05:02,040 --> 01:05:03,910
[Seungho: It's a bit hard to express it
accurately in words.]

1415
01:05:03,910 --> 01:05:06,310
[Seungho: It just feels a little different.]

1416
01:05:06,840 --> 01:05:09,250
[Seungho: What about you? Am I how you imagined]

1417
01:05:09,250 --> 01:05:11,110
[Seungho: when you sent the date request?]

1418
01:05:11,110 --> 01:05:12,980
[Yongkyu: I got to...]

1419
01:05:12,980 --> 01:05:14,580
[Yongkyu: I got to know more about you.]

1420
01:05:14,580 --> 01:05:17,790
[Yongkyu: Seeing you more relaxed,]

1421
01:05:17,790 --> 01:05:20,720
[Yongkyu: I felt more relaxed too.]

1422
01:05:20,720 --> 01:05:23,020
[Yongkyu: I really saw you acting relaxed.]

1423
01:05:23,020 --> 01:05:25,530
[Seungho: That's true.]

1424
01:05:26,060 --> 01:05:27,930
[Seungho: There aren't many people here
I can speak informally to.]

1425
01:05:27,930 --> 01:05:29,530
[Yongkyu: People you speak informally to?]

1426
01:05:29,530 --> 01:05:32,200
[Yongkyu: Why don't you?]

1427
01:05:32,200 --> 01:05:35,940
[Seungho: Because no one else does. I'm younger,
so it'd feel awkward to bring it up.]

1428
01:05:35,940 --> 01:05:40,210
[Yongkyu: Then why did you just
speak informally to me?]

1429
01:05:42,340 --> 01:05:44,210
[Yongkyu: If today...]

1430
01:05:44,210 --> 01:05:49,290
[Yongkyu: I hadn't sent you an SBM Talk,
who would you have gone on a date with?]

1431
01:05:50,090 --> 01:05:51,950
[Seungho: Wait a minute.]

1432
01:05:51,950 --> 01:05:53,290
[Yongkyu: What's wrong? Are you choking?]

1433
01:05:53,290 --> 01:05:55,960
[Yongkyu: Should I ask later?]

1434
01:05:56,760 --> 01:06:00,760
[Seungho: I probably would still
have chosen you too.]

1435
01:06:01,030 --> 01:06:04,500
[Yongkyu: So my message gave you
some extra certainty? Is that how it felt?]

1436
01:06:04,500 --> 01:06:05,840
[Seungho: Yeah.]

1437
01:06:06,900 --> 01:06:09,570
[Yongkyu: I've always wanted to talk to you.]

1438
01:06:09,570 --> 01:06:11,710
[Yongkyu: And I like you.]

1439
01:06:13,310 --> 01:06:16,510
["I Like you"]

1440
01:06:16,750 --> 01:06:17,740
I like you.

1441
01:06:18,300 --> 01:06:20,460
[Shy]

1442
01:06:20,540 --> 01:06:21,850
[Yongkyu: Not eating any more?]

1443
01:06:21,850 --> 01:06:23,720
[Seungho: No. I suddenly feel full.]

1444
01:06:21,930 --> 01:06:23,730
-No. I suddenly feel full.
-Suddenly...

1445
01:06:23,720 --> 01:06:24,740
[Seungho: Why is that?]

1446
01:06:24,740 --> 01:06:26,180
[Yongkyu: Sudden indigestion?]

1447
01:06:26,180 --> 01:06:27,520
[Seungho: No, not really.]

1448
01:06:27,520 --> 01:06:28,850
[Seungho: I ate a lot already.]

1449
01:06:28,850 --> 01:06:30,190
[Yongkyu: You did eat quite a lot.]

1450
01:06:30,720 --> 01:06:33,390
[Yongkyu: Dinner over for today?]

1451
01:06:33,390 --> 01:06:34,460
[Seungho: Over!]

1452
01:06:34,720 --> 01:06:36,860
[Seungho: Everyone's probably
back at BI-LIVE by now, right?]

1453
01:06:36,860 --> 01:06:37,660
[Yongkyu: Now?]

1454
01:06:37,660 --> 01:06:38,730
[Seungho: Only the two of us are still outside.]

1455
01:06:40,600 --> 01:06:42,460
[A mission message arrives for both]

1456
01:06:40,640 --> 01:06:41,510
Yeah.

1457
01:06:42,730 --> 01:06:45,130
[Seungho: Is it a group notice?]

1458
01:06:45,400 --> 01:06:46,470
[Seungho: Where did I put my phone?]

1459
01:06:46,910 --> 01:06:47,910
Did you leave it in the car?

1460
01:06:47,800 --> 01:06:49,140
[Yongkyu: Is it in the room?]

1461
01:06:51,770 --> 01:06:52,970
Is it in there?

1462
01:06:58,940 --> 01:07:01,420
[One missed call]

1463
01:07:01,420 --> 01:07:03,550
[Seungho: When I picked up my phone,]

1464
01:07:03,550 --> 01:07:05,150
[Seungho: it said I had a missed call.]

1465
01:07:05,950 --> 01:07:08,360
[Seungho: Hello...]

1466
01:07:08,360 --> 01:07:10,490
[Seungho: What?]

1467
01:07:10,490 --> 01:07:12,630
[Seungho: What is this?]

1468
01:07:14,230 --> 01:07:15,560
[Seungho: What?]

1469
01:07:19,030 --> 01:07:21,170
[Seungho: Why are you calling me all of a sudden?]

1470
01:07:21,970 --> 01:07:26,740
[Who is calling Seungho?]
